          sanskrit: 'अ॒यं द॑क्षि॒णा वि॒श्वक॑र्मा॒ तस्य॒ मनो॑ वैश्वकर्म॒णं ग्री॒ष्मो मा॑न॒सस्त्रिष्टुब्ग्रै॒ष्मी॑ त्रि॒ष्टुभ॑: स्वा॒रᳪ\nस्वा॒राद॑न्तर्या॒मो॒ऽन्तर्या॒मात्प॑ञ्चद॒शः प॑ञ्चद॒शाद् बृ॒हद् भ॒रद्वा॑ज॒  ऋषि॑: प्र॒जाप॑तिगृहीतया॒ त्वया॒ मनो॑ गृह्णामि प्र॒जाभ्य॑:',
          transliteration: '',
          translation: 'This on the right, the Omnific. His, the Omnific\'s offspring, Mind. Summer sprang from Mind. The Trishtup is the daughter of Summer. From the Trishtup came the Svâra song. From the Svâra the Antaryâma. From the Antaryâma the Pa&ntilde;chadasa. From the Pa&ntilde;chadasa the Brihat. The Rishi Bharadvâja. By thee, taken by Prajâpati, I take Mind for creatures.',
          hindi: 'उशना-हित की कामनावाले के तीन मौलिक सिद्धान्त होने चाहिए-(१) शरणागत की रक्षा (२) ज्ञान को नैत्यिक भोजन समञ्जना। (३) स्वयं सन्तानों का सरक्षक १. प्रभु (सबका भला चाहनेवाले) उशना से कहते है कि त्वा=तुञ्ञे अपाम् एमन्=वायु में (वायुर्वा अपामेम- श० ७।५।२।४६) सादयामि स्थापित करता हूं, अर्थात् तुञ्ञे वायु के',
          explanation: 'This on the right, the Omnific. His, the Omnific\'s offspring, Mind. Summer sprang from Mind. The Trishtup is the daughter of Summer. From the Trishtup came the Svâra song. From the Svâra the Antaryâma. From the Antaryâma the Pa&ntilde;chadasa. From the Pa&ntilde;chadasa the Brihat. The Rishi Bharadvâja. By thee, taken by Prajâpati, I take Mind for creatures.',
